        ],
        "text": "During oral argument, Justices Stevens, Kennedy, and Ginsburg posed questions concerning the timing of facts relative to the crime, the effect of post\u2011crime conduct, and the origins and prevalence of the factor (k) instruction."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Souter",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "359c1a228a56a793fcb9adac51b014dfecbc660d2c9b9f37e20fa1cde17d08f1",
